  "body": "Third production-readiness upgrade, stacked on PR #50.\n\nScope is deliberately limited to **triage ranking**.\n\nAdds:\n- automatic `triage_ranking.json/md` after coverage/gaps + challenger;\n- explicit `scan-body triage-gaps DB --out-dir DIR` regeneration command;\n- transparent 0..100 investigation score composed from:\n  - structural connectivity (20 max),\n  - actionable human-surface reach (30 max),\n  - effect/state/NEST/feedback reach (20 max),\n  - reconstruction-anchor dependency (20 max),\n  - challenger mechanical-recheck support (10 max);\n- raw signal counts and component contributions emitted for every ranked gap;\n- deterministic tie-breaking by gap ID;\n- high-degree connectivity capped so generic hubs cannot dominate.\n\nAuthority boundary:\n- ranking means investigation leverage only, not truth;\n- no confidence effect;\n- no promotion effect;\n- no canonical writes;\n- coverage state and gap category are not score weights;\n- no LLM dependency.\n\nLayered provenance is intentionally the next independent roadmap stage.",
